  "design": {
    "decision": "Whether to bid one more trick to top the opponents' total, knowing a set doubles the loss as well; the last bidder weighs this hardest.",
    "opponent": "Revealed at the first scoring; after that the opponents can bid up to deny it, at the risk of being set themselves.",
    "rationale": "A broad, interactive Bid High ×mult: it fires about half the time, raises the stakes with the bid (it applies on sets), and turns bidding into a contest instead of a fixed threshold; it differs from ub-outbid-mult in category and power.",
